message: "If you use SR-HazardMaker, please cite it as below."
title: "SR-HazardMaker"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Taciroglu
    given-names: E.
    affiliation: "University of California, Los Angeles"
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-18
url: "https://trg-ucla.github.io/SR-HazardMaker/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/TRG-UCLA/SR-HazardMaker"
license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: "Turns ground-motion data (USGS National Seismic Hazard Model tables, USGS ShakeMaps, and tables of points) into hazard layers for the ShakeReady map, with checks and a record of each layer's source. A browser app and a command-line tool that are tested to produce the same layers."
keywords:
  - earthquake
  - seismic hazard
  - ground motion
  - ShakeMap
  - ShakeReady
